THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

The `kdi` crate bundles a compiled USB3 device driver for each supported platform,
under `vendor/`. These files are NOT covered by the Apache License above. They
are third-party binaries redistributed with permission; each one's origin, byte
length and SHA-256 are recorded in `src/bundled.rs`, which is compiled in
whether or not the `bundled` feature is enabled, so the provenance travels with
every copy of this crate.

Only the `bundled` feature embeds these bytes into your artifact. A default
build links none of them and loads a driver from the filesystem instead.

